      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为新人训练员，因为内心的不安而把时间都花在了准备上……\n甚至迟迟不敢向赛马娘搭话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0277044f65ce63eeb6096ad32ff8f89e0dd48777c440ab05d8ca4d49a6cbb48c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
